    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "plst",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113985479517679418659/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ8rXyNLjGbcT7Dq7KEeeeMGizN_kxtiyaCkmR5gVRNpLRt9g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I was there on Thursday. No help offered, no hello. Staff were chatting with each other and when I asked a question they looked at me in pure disgust. This isn’t the first time I get a bad experience at this location. Clearly they can’t find acceptable quality staff.",
        "time": 1764492474,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Yasmine Benabed",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103711017199593050962/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVq8BV-oRcxqeHPPf6DuFJFo3yFZPzMiFLlObfzEjDeiAvKaj53=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "This comment is directed to the whole Garage brand - If you noticed Garage recent rebranding (they improved their marketing), you also noticed the significant increase of their price range. I was curious to see how would the quality match the general price increase. I can give it to you straight, the quality is still mediocre : I bought a tiny crop top for 26$ that I found very cute, I wore it for a total of 5 times (washed it 5 times, gentle cycle, cold water) and I can already see holes in the fabric, along the rib-cage line (not under the armpits). Please don't get lured by their new marketing. The quality is still way below expectations.",
        "time": 1590585229,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "jennifer kudzman",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106126579444651316483/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUy6R0dTZgS9sfN2fQaVZDV2ka-wasfmPxNFkrr7jZ5_JZtb_VxXg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "It was all right, nobody kind of helped me when I was caring about seven pieces of clothing and it would have been more of a enjoyable experience if somebody had come up and put it in the room for me but I didn't know where to put it and anyhow it's not a big deal the store was clean and everything so they had a great selection! I guess it all depends on the staff at the moment.",
        "time": 1739403244,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Krystal Marlin",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108321130068947890111/reviews",
